This is a placeholder. The actual gradle-wrapper.jar binary must be committed separately as it is a JAR file.
For now, please download the official Gradle wrapper JAR from:
https://github.com/gradle/gradle/releases/download/v8.5/gradle-wrapper.jar

Extract it and place it at: android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

Or run this command to auto-download:
  cd android && gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.5
